    "start": "work_done",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "work_done",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "小夜香拿着会诊单走到办公室门口。\n\n「喏，你要的。」\n\n坂口接过：「谢了。」\n\n她用笔点点最后一页。\n\n「先别谢。这里，签。」\n\n坂口：「你现在很像来催债的。」\n\n她笑了：「那你快点还。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_turn",
            "label": "签完交还给她",
            "next": "does_not_leave",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "does_not_leave",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "坂口签完，她确认一眼，转身走了两步，又折回来。\n\n「对了，手机给我。」\n\n坂口：「手机？」\n\n她伸出手。\n\n「号码。」\n\n「你手机给我，我也用不上。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_direct",
            "label": "工作联系？",
            "next": "direct_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "direct_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她低头点开联系人。\n\n「一半吧。」\n\n坂口：「另一半？」\n\n她抬眼看他。\n\n「以后再说。」\n\n坂口把号码报给她。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "exchange_number",
            "label": "等她输入号码",
            "next": "saved_name",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "saved_name",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "几秒后，坂口的手机震了一下。\n\n南条小夜香：我是南条。\n\n坂口：「我知道。」\n\n「通讯录不知道。」\n\n她凑过来看他保存联系人。\n\n「诶，等等。你不会真存‘南条医生’吧？」\n\n「看起来像医院群发名单。」\n\n坂口：「那存什么？」\n\n她脱口而出：「小夜香。」\n\n两个人对视。她先移开一点视线，自己笑了。\n\n「……先别真改。还没熟到那儿。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_tail_a",
            "label": "你也会不好意思？",
            "next": "tail_a",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          },
          {
            "id": "phone_tail_b",
            "label": "所以只能工作联系？",
            "next": "tail_b",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          },
          {
            "id": "phone_tail_c",
            "label": "半夜两点能发消息吗？",
            "next": "tail_c",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tail_a",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她立刻看回来。\n\n「少来。」\n\n她把手机塞回白大褂口袋。\n\n「半夜别发奇怪东西。」\n\n坂口：「什么算奇怪？」\n\n她走出去前回头。\n\n「你先发。我负责鉴定。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_end_a",
            "label": "记下她的号码",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_phone_exchanged",
              "sayaka_sunday_invite_available",
              "sayaka_private_contact_open"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tail_b",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她眨了一下眼。\n\n「我可没这么说。」\n\n「工作以外能不能联系——你先试试不就知道了？」\n\n说完，她自己先笑了。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_end_b",
            "label": "保存联系人",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_phone_exchanged",
              "sayaka_sunday_invite_available",
              "sayaka_private_contact_open"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tail_c",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「半夜两点别发无聊消息。」\n\n坂口：「什么算无聊？」\n\n她看他一眼。\n\n「你先发。我收到以后再判断。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "phone_end_c",
            "label": "收起手机",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_phone_exchanged",
              "sayaka_sunday_invite_available",
              "sayaka_private_contact_open"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
