  {
    "id": "sayaka_lv1_first_date",
    "actor_id": "doc_sayaka",
    "title": "所以这算约会吗？",
    "chapter": 1,
    "location_id": "player_office",
    "trigger_mode": "sunday",
    "background_id": "italian_trattoria",
    "outfit": "casual",
    "minutes": 120,
    "teaser": "第一个星期日，坂口主动给小夜香发了消息。",
    "time_start": 540,
    "time_end": 1020,
    "priority": 200,
    "category": "bond",
    "gallery": {
      "cg_id": "cg_sayaka_lv1_first_date",
      "caption": "所以这算约会吗？",
      "path": "assets/events/character_events/sayaka/lv1_split_bill.png",
      "show_on_complete": true
    },
    "conditions": {
      "min_day": 2,
      "min_affection": 0,
      "min_familiarity": 0,
      "required_events": [
        "sayaka_week1_phone_exchange"
      ],
      "special_requirements": []
    },
    "start": "invite",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "invite",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "星期日。\n\n坂口：今天有空？一起吃饭？\n\n她很快回复。\n\n小夜香：有啊。\n\n隔了几秒，又来一条。\n\n小夜香：诶，你第一个星期天就点我？\n\n坂口：只是吃饭。\n\n小夜香：“只是”两个字听起来最可疑。\n\n小夜香：行，地址发我。",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "go_trattoria",
            "label": "去约好的意大利小餐馆",
            "next": "arrival",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "arrival",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "坂口到的时候，小夜香已经站在餐厅门口。\n\n坂口：「你比我早。」\n\n她看了一眼手机。\n\n「两分钟。别讲得像我在门口望夫石一样。」\n\n她也看向暖灯和小双人桌。\n\n「你还挺会挑。」\n\n坂口：「怎么？」\n\n她指了指里面。\n\n「这个地方很容易让人误会诶。」\n\n「误会什么？」\n\n她笑得很自然。\n\n「误会你在约我啊。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "sit_down",
            "label": "进去坐下",
            "next": "outside_coat",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "outside_coat",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她翻开菜单。\n\n「医院外面看你还挺新鲜的。」\n\n坂口：「哪里不一样？」\n\n她抬眼认真看了两秒。\n\n「没白大褂。」\n\n坂口：「你也没。」\n\n她低头看看自己的衣服。\n\n「怎么，失望？」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "outfit_miss_coat",
            "label": "有一点",
            "next": "coat_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 1,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          },
          {
            "id": "outfit_pretty",
            "label": "这样也很好看",
            "next": "pretty_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 2,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          },
          {
            "id": "outfit_same",
            "label": "我还在适应",
            "next": "same_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "coat_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她扬眉。\n\n「哦？」\n\n坂口：「白大褂挺适合你。」\n\n她嘴角翘起来。\n\n「现在才发现？」\n\n「观察力不太行啊，坂口医生。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "coat_continue",
            "label": "聊聊周末",
            "next": "men_too_few",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "pretty_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她原本准备继续看菜单，动作停了一下。\n\n「……你今天嘴怎么这么甜。」\n\n坂口：「实话。」\n\n她看他一眼，又低下头。\n\n「行。算你赢一次。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "pretty_continue",
            "label": "聊聊周末",
            "next": "men_too_few",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "same_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她笑起来。\n\n「慢慢适应。以后还有机会。」\n\n说完，她自己先意识到这句话有点暧昧，抿了一下嘴。\n\n「……我是说周日。」\n\n坂口：「我什么都没说。」\n\n她瞪过来。\n\n「你闭嘴。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "same_continue",
            "label": "聊聊周末",
            "next": "men_too_few",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "men_too_few",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "坂口：「你周末平时都这么过？」\n\n「吃饭、逛街、喝点东西。」\n\n她叉起一小块食物。\n\n「有男人约的话，看人。」\n\n坂口：「这么直接？」\n\n「喜欢男人有什么好装的。」\n\n她看他一眼。\n\n「不过我也不是谁约都来。」\n\n坂口：「所以今天算通过筛选？」\n\n她笑了。\n\n「目前。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "like_men",
            "label": "所以今天算通过筛选？",
            "next": "added_value",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 1,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "added_value",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她笑了。\n\n「目前。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "meal_nearly_done",
            "label": "继续吃完晚餐",
            "next": "what_is_this",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "what_is_this",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "饭快结束时，她用指尖转了一下杯子，忽然抬眼。\n\n「我问你个事。」\n\n坂口：「嗯。」\n\n她没有绕。\n\n「今天这个——」\n\n「算约会吗？」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "date_direct",
            "label": "当然算",
            "next": "direct_date_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 3,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_mutual_attraction",
              "sayaka_lv1_path_direct"
            ],
            "clear_flags": [
              "sayaka_first_date_retry_pending"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "date_tease",
            "label": "你希望它算吗？",
            "next": "teasing_date_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 3,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_mutual_attraction",
              "sayaka_lv1_path_teasing"
            ],
            "clear_flags": [
              "sayaka_first_date_retry_pending"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "date_only_meal",
            "label": "只是出来吃顿饭",
            "next": "only_meal_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 1,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_romantic_interest_visible",
              "sayaka_first_date_retry_pending"
            ],
            "clear_flags": [
              "sayaka_mutual_attraction"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "direct_date_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她明显愣了半拍。\n\n「……这么干脆？」\n\n坂口：「不然呢？」\n\n她笑起来。\n\n「行。这个答案我喜欢。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "direct_to_bill",
            "label": "等账单送来",
            "next": "bill",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "teasing_date_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她几乎没有犹豫。\n\n「希望啊。」\n\n说完，反而被坂口看得有点不自在。\n\n「干嘛？」\n\n坂口：「你答得挺快。」\n\n她轻咳一声。\n\n「我都出来了，还装什么。」\n\n「所以你呢？」\n\n坂口：「那今天算。」\n\n她点头。\n\n「好。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "tease_to_bill",
            "label": "等账单送来",
            "next": "bill",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "only_meal_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「哦。」\n\n她若无其事地吃掉最后一口，然后抬眼。\n\n「那我下次努力一点。」\n\n坂口：「努力什么？」\n\n她笑了。\n\n「让它更像约会。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "only_meal_end",
            "label": "结束这顿饭",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_romantic_interest_visible",
              "sayaka_first_date_retry_pending"
            ],
            "clear_flags": [
              "sayaka_mutual_attraction"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "bill",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "服务员放下账单。坂口刚伸手，小夜香已经把卡拿出来。\n\n「AA。」\n\n坂口：「我请吧。」\n\n她摇头。\n\n「不要。」\n\n坂口刚准备说话，她先抬手。\n\n「诶，先别自己脑补。」\n\n「我不是跟你划线，也不是在说‘我们只是朋友’。」\n\n她把自己的卡放到桌上。\n\n「我约会就这样。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask_aa",
            "label": "原则？",
            "next": "aa_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "aa_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她点头。\n\n「嗯。」\n\n停了一下，她冲坂口眨眼。\n\n「钱各付各的。」\n\n「别的嘛……以后再说。」\n\n坂口：「你故意的？」\n\n她笑得很开心。\n\n「当然。」",
        "expression": "happy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "leave_restaurant",
            "label": "饭后一起走一段",
            "next": "walk_home",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "walk_home",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "饭后，两个人沿街走了一小段。分别前，小夜香停下来。\n\n「今天不错。」\n\n坂口：「只是不错？」\n\n她看他：「你还想要几分？」\n\n「至少有下次？」\n\n她终于笑得有点可爱。\n\n「有啊。不然我刚才跟你说‘以后再说’干嘛。」\n\n走出两步，她又回头。\n\n「下次还是你约。」\n\n坂口：「为什么？」\n\n她想了想。\n\n「因为被喜欢的人主动约，感觉还不错。」\n\n说完，她自己先有一点不好意思，马上补了一句：\n\n「行了，别得意。」",
        "expression": "happy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "date_success_end",
            "label": "和她道别",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 2,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "sayaka_first_date_completed",
              "sayaka_mutual_attraction",
              "sayaka_romantic_interest_confirmed",
              "sayaka_lv2_eligible_base"
            ],
            "clear_flags": [
              "sayaka_first_date_retry_pending"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
